==Battleground==
*2 [[Zapy|Zapies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldstrich]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zapy]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use a Rich Cat since there's not much cash flow here, or rush this level if your [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] are strong enough.

Stall the first Zapy with basic meatshields like [[Shigong Cat]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Eraser]] and stack [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance units]] like [[Housewife Cat]] and [[Fried Chicken Cat]]. Vanquish the first Zapy with a [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]], then try to deal some damage to the second Zapy. When Oldstrich comes out, spam all your anti-Zombie units and you'll win.

